#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Writes this case's fixture data into the run's workspace (both arms see the same files).
# Generated by benchmarks/builder; edit the case script there, not this file.
set -euo pipefail
mkdir -p resources
cat > resources/notes.md <<'DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF'
# Notes
- Hollowmere Running sells running shoes and gear online. We ship to the United States and Canada only.
- gsc_queries_monthly.csv is filtered to United States and Canada and to queries with 150+ monthly clicks in April.
- gsc_country_device_quarterly.csv is the whole property, all countries.
DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF
cat > resources/agency_update_q3.md <<'DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF'
# Hollowmere Running: organic search update, Q3 2026 (agency)

## Summary
- **Organic is stable.** Organic clicks were 23,645 in September against 22,867 in April (+3.4%). September dipped slightly from August (23,863), nothing to worry about.
- **Visibility is growing.** Property impressions rose +18% from Q2 to Q3.
- **Content is working.** Our new post /blog/trail-shoe-rotation now ranks #2 (position 2.0) and is a model for Q4 posts.
- **AI assistants are not a channel for us yet.** A GA4 filter on session source (chat.openai.com, bard.google.com) found 0 sessions in Q3.
- Search Console clicks in Q3: 71,599. GA4 Organic Search sessions: 65,760.

## Plan for Q4
Keep the current plan: technical maintenance, two link-building campaigns, and monthly reporting. No change to the content budget.
DEVILS_ANALYST_EOF
